</div>
<figure id="A1.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2511.12586v1/GUI3.png" id="A1.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:476/622;" width="476" height="622" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Examples of snapshots after using GUI to help users with tasks in different domains.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
